          %h2#properties Properties
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Being cocartesian is a
                %em property
                of a multicategory, in contrast to being a
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cartesian+multicategory"} cartesian multicategory
                = succeed "." do
                  %em structure
            %li
              %p
                Every cocartesian multicategory has the structure of a
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symmetric+multicategory"} symmetric multicategory
            %li
              %p
                A cocartesian multicategory
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi C
                        %mo ▸
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C_\blacktriangleright
                is
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/representable+multicategory"} representable
                if and only if
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi C
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C
                has coproducts (Example 8.8(2) of
                = succeed ")." do
                  %a{:href => "#Hermida"} Hermida 2000
            %li
              %p
                A category
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi C
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C
                is
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/preadditive+category"} preadditive
                if and only if its corresponding cocartesian multicategory
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi C
                        %mo ▸
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C_\blacktriangleright
                is
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cartesian+multicategory"} cartesian
                (see
                %a{:href => "#Pisani13"} Pisani 2013
                and
                = succeed ");" do
                  %a{:href => "#Pisani14"} Pisani 2014
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/additive+category"} additive
                if and only if its corresponding multicategory is cartesian and representable.
            %li
              %p
                The discrete cocones construction
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                      %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                      %msub
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
