                      %mo :
                      %mi Cat
                      %mo →
                      %mi Multicat
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (-)_\blacktriangleright : Cat \to Multicat
                is left adjoint to the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+of+monoids"} category of monoids
                construction
                = succeed "," do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
